 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "By faith we understand the universe formed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "By the word of God, not from visible things",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Abel offered a better sacrifice",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Commended as righteous through his own belief",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Without faith it is impossible to please him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever comes to God must believe he exists",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And that he rewards those who seek him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Faith is the key to his love",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Enoch was taken up, did not see death",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Commended as one who pleased God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Noah built the ark in reverent fear",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Heir of the righteousness that comes by faith",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Without faith it is impossible to please him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever comes to God must believe he exists",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And that he rewards those who seek him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Faith is the key to his love",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Abraham obeyed when he was called",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To go out to a place as inheritance",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He went not knowing where he was going",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
